<title>DUBAI: KPC lifts November LPG prices to $250 a tonne.</title>
<headline>KPC lifts November LPG prices to $250 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) on Thursday announced that it was raising its propane and butane prices for November lifting to $250 a tonne, up $45.</p>
</text>
